        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ঘুড়ি",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঘুড়ি — ghuṛi — \"a paper kite; a kite (toy)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ছুটির দিনে ছেলেরা ছাদে ঘুড়ি নিয়ে খেলছিল। chhuṭir dine chhelerā chhāde ghuṛi niye khelchhilô. On the holiday the boys were playing with kites on the roof."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঘুড়ি (ghuṛi) is the paper kite; its origin is not settled. A kite the bird is চিল."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
